    <div class="marquee-item" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_1369.jpg" data-caption="Coconut break facing the Andaman Sea, Krabi" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/thumbs/IMG_1369-700.webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_1369.jpg" alt=""></picture><span class="cap">Krabi · Andaman Sea</span></div>
    <div class="marquee-item" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_5519.jpg" data-caption="Kayaking in the mangrove, southern Thailand" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/thumbs/IMG_5519-700.webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_5519.jpg" alt=""></picture><span class="cap">Kayaking in the mangrove</span></div>
    <div class="marquee-item" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_5227.jpg" data-caption="Golden temple of Doi Suthep, Chiang Mai" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/thumbs/IMG_5227-700.webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_5227.jpg" alt=""></picture><span class="cap">Doi Suthep · Chiang Mai</span></div>
    <div class="marquee-item" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_9507.jpg" data-caption="Erawan Falls, Kanchanaburi" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/thumbs/IMG_9507-700.webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_9507.jpg" alt=""></picture><span class="cap">Erawan Falls</span></div>
    <div class="marquee-item" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_4231.jpg" data-caption="Turquoise waters of Koh Tao" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/thumbs/IMG_4231-700.webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_4231.jpg" alt=""></picture><span class="cap">Koh Tao</span></div>
    <div class="marquee-item" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_2016.jpg" data-caption="Sunset on Koh Lanta beach" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/thumbs/IMG_2016-700.webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_2016.jpg" alt=""></picture><span class="cap">Sunset · Koh Lanta</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div style="background:var(--navy);text-align:center;padding:16px 0 28px">
  <a class="text-link" href="/galerie/" style="color:var(--on-dark-mute);font-size:0.9rem">
    See the full gallery (FR)
    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
  </a>
</div>

<!-- ============ INTRO POLAROID ANAÏS ============ -->
<section class="section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-polaroid">
      <div class="polaroid-wrap" data-reveal="left">
        <div class="polaroid-frame">
          <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_5300.jpg" alt="Anaïs with elephants in Thailand" width="800" height="1067">
          <div class="polaroid-caption">Three years ago, I unpacked my bags here.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="polaroid-badge" aria-label="100% tailor-made">
          <div class="badge-num">100%</div>
          <div class="badge-txt">Tailor<br>made</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-text-wrap" data-reveal="right">
        <p class="eyebrow">Welcome!</p>
        <h2>I'm Anaïs, your travel planner in Thailand</h2>
        <hr class="divider">
        <p class="lead intro-drop-cap">Three years ago, I unpacked my bags on the island of Koh Lanta. What was meant to be a short sabbatical turned into an entire life — an island, a community, and hundreds of travelers for whom I've designed <em>their</em> ideal Thailand.</p>
        <p>Choosing regions, seasons, transport, accommodation, activities… planning a trip to Southeast Asia can quickly become a headache. My role: turn your project into a clear itinerary, tailored to your style, your budget and what you love.</p>
        <a class="text-link mt-s" href="/en/a-propos/">Learn more about my story <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

