          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Personalized advice &amp; local tips</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Complete digital travel journal</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Pre-trip support &amp; WhatsApp assistance 7 days a week</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/contact/"><span>Get a quote</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="formule featured" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        <span class="badge">Most popular</span>
